\ front_gameplay.6502 - the gameplay flags' part of the front end (decisions 44-47): bank 5, after
\ the front end's music, so nothing before it moves. start_game runs with bank 5 paged (measured
\ 2026-10-20), so it calls shield_new_game here.

\ shield_new_game: start_game's lives, and each flag's settings for the game: the game rules
\ screen's (GAMEPLAY_OPTIONS) or the build's. The shield and the timer set themselves up at the
\ first pass (shield_ready, timer_ready).
.shield_new_game
IF GAMEPLAY_OPTIONS
    LDA opt_lives                   \ 1-9, or OPT_INFINITE (10: lives_digits' glyph there)
    STA lives
    LDX opt_respawn
    LDA opt_respawn_columns,X
    STA respawn_columns
    LDA opt_timer
    STA timer_mode
    STZ game_completed              \ 65C02 opcode: the headquarters not reached
    LDX opt_hits                    \ decision 50: the shield's hits and its recharge
    LDA opt_hits_unit,X
    STA shield_unit
    ASL A
    STA shield_unit2
    LDX opt_recharge
    LDA opt_recharge_passes,X
    STA shield_recharge
ELSE
    LDA #SHIELD_UNIT                \ decision 50: as decision 44
    STA shield_unit
    LDA #2 * SHIELD_UNIT
    STA shield_unit2
    LDA #SHIELD_WAIT
    STA shield_recharge
  IF GAMEPLAY_LIVES
    LDA #LIVES_START                \ decision 45
  ELSE
    LDA #&09                        \ Player starts with nine lives
  ENDIF
    STA lives
  IF GAMEPLAY_LIVES
    LDA #RESPAWN_COLUMNS
    STA respawn_columns
  ENDIF
  IF GAMEPLAY_TIMER
    LDA #GAMEPLAY_TIMER
    STA timer_mode
  ENDIF
ENDIF
    STZ shield_ready                \ 65C02 opcode
IF GAMEPLAY_TIMER
    STZ timer_ready                 \ decision 47
ENDIF
    RTS

IF GAMEPLAY_OPTIONS
    INCLUDE "options.6502"          \ decision 46: the game rules screen
ENDIF
